{"starts": [0.0, 5.564541, 10.713207, 15.475456000000001, 21.203622000000003, 28.204538000000003, 33.705412, 42.133578], "total": 49.424036, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasa si te entierran vivo? Spoiler: tu peor enemigo sería tu propio pánico.", "words": [["Qué", 0.095458, 0.220458], ["pasa", 0.231833, 0.493208], ["si", 0.504541, 0.640916], ["te", 0.652291, 0.731832], ["entierran", 0.743166, 1.152249], ["vivo", 1.163625, 1.504541], ["Spoiler", 2.295458, 2.874999], ["tu", 3.136375, 3.238666], ["peor", 3.25, 3.511375], ["enemigo", 3.522708, 3.920416], ["sería", 3.931833, 4.272749], ["tu", 4.284083, 4.397708], ["propio", 4.409083, 4.738624], ["pánico", 4.75, 5.204541]], "dur": 5.524541}, {"text": "Dentro de un ataúd normal hay aire para unas pocas horas, y depende de cuánto te agites.", "words": [["Dentro", 0.095458, 0.459083], ["de", 0.470458, 0.561374], ["un", 0.572708, 0.709083], ["ataúd", 0.720458, 1.061374], ["normal", 1.072708, 1.436333], ["hay", 1.447708, 1.584083], ["aire", 1.595458, 1.845458], ["para", 1.856833, 2.072749], ["unas", 2.084083, 2.356791], ["pocas", 2.368166, 2.709082], ["horas", 2.720458, 3.038624], ["y", 3.243166, 3.311332], ["depende", 3.322708, 3.720416], ["de", 3.731833, 3.845458], ["cuánto", 3.856833, 4.174999], ["te", 4.186375, 4.265916], ["agites", 4.277291, 4.788666]], "dur": 5.108666}, {"text": "Si entras en pánico, respiras más rápido y gastas el oxígeno mucho antes.", "words": [["Si", 0.095458, 0.334083], ["entras", 0.345458, 0.652291], ["en", 0.663625, 0.77725], ["pánico", 0.788625, 1.209083], ["respiras", 1.481833, 1.959124], ["más", 1.970458, 2.174999], ["rápido", 2.186375, 2.527291], ["y", 2.538625, 2.584083], ["gastas", 2.595458, 3.004541], ["el", 3.015916, 3.106832], ["oxígeno", 3.118166, 3.584082], ["mucho", 3.595458, 3.936374], ["antes", 3.947708, 4.402249]], "dur": 4.722249000000001}, {"text": "Mientras tanto, el dióxido de carbono se acumula: llegan el mareo, la confusión y el desmayo.", "words": [["Mientras", 0.095458, 0.504541], ["tanto", 0.515916, 0.879541], ["el", 1.129541, 1.277249], ["dióxido", 1.288625, 1.675], ["de", 1.686375, 1.777291], ["carbono", 1.788625, 2.197708], ["se", 2.209083, 2.311374], ["acumula", 2.322708, 2.777249], ["llegan", 3.038625, 3.322708], ["el", 3.334083, 3.436374], ["mareo", 3.447708, 3.811333], ["la", 4.072708, 4.152249], ["confusión", 4.163625, 4.686333], ["y", 4.697708, 4.777249], ["el", 4.788625, 4.856791], ["desmayo", 4.868166, 5.368166]], "dur": 5.688166000000001}, {"text": "Escapar es casi imposible: con casi dos metros de tierra encima, la tapa cedería y todo ese peso te caería encima.", "words": [["Escapar", 0.095458, 0.549999], ["es", 0.561375, 0.675], ["casi", 0.686375, 0.959083], ["imposible", 0.970458, 1.527291], ["con", 1.754541, 1.936374], ["casi", 1.947708, 2.231791], ["dos", 2.243166, 2.436332], ["metros", 2.447708, 2.754541], ["de", 2.765916, 2.856832], ["tierra", 2.868166, 3.118166], ["encima", 3.129541, 3.527249], ["la", 3.834083, 3.924999], ["tapa", 3.936375, 4.19775], ["cedería", 4.209083, 4.686374], ["y", 4.697708, 4.788624], ["todo", 4.8, 5.095458], ["ese", 5.106833, 5.311374], ["peso", 5.322708, 5.629541], ["te", 5.640916, 5.754541], ["caería", 5.765916, 6.174999], ["encima", 6.186375, 6.640916]], "dur": 6.960916}, {"text": "En el siglo diecinueve el miedo era tan grande que se inventaron ataúdes con campanas para pedir ayuda.", "words": [["En", 0.095458, 0.254541], ["el", 0.265916, 0.379541], ["siglo", 0.390916, 0.674999], ["diecinueve", 0.686375, 1.163666], ["el", 1.175, 1.265916], ["miedo", 1.277291, 1.584124], ["era", 1.595458, 1.754541], ["tan", 1.765916, 1.959082], ["grande", 1.970458, 2.288624], ["que", 2.3, 2.413625], ["se", 2.425, 2.527291], ["inventaron", 2.538625, 3.084083], ["ataúdes", 3.095458, 3.538624], ["con", 3.55, 3.686375], ["campanas", 3.697708, 4.220416], ["para", 4.231833, 4.436374], ["pedir", 4.447708, 4.731791], ["ayuda", 4.743166, 5.140874]], "dur": 5.4608740000000004}, {"text": "Hoy casi no ocurre, porque un médico tiene que certificar la muerte. Pero en mil novecientos quince, Houdini lo intentó y casi no sale.", "words": [["Hoy", 0.095458, 0.277291], ["casi", 0.288625, 0.584083], ["no", 0.595458, 0.731833], ["ocurre", 0.743166, 1.174999], ["porque", 1.425, 1.686375], ["un", 1.697708, 1.822708], ["médico", 1.834083, 2.197708], ["tiene", 2.209083, 2.459083], ["que", 2.470458, 2.561374], ["certificar", 2.572708, 3.174999], ["la", 3.186375, 3.265916], ["muerte", 3.277291, 3.697749], ["Pero", 4.477291, 4.670457], ["en", 4.681833, 4.749999], ["mil", 4.761375, 4.909083], ["novecientos", 4.920458, 5.454541], ["quince", 5.465916, 5.818207], ["Houdini", 6.090916, 6.545457], ["lo", 6.556833, 6.647749], ["intentó", 6.659083, 7.090916], ["y", 7.102291, 7.181832], ["casi", 7.193166, 7.534082], ["no", 7.545458, 7.693166], ["sale", 7.704541, 8.068166]], "dur": 8.388166}, {"text": "¿Parte cuatro? ¿Qué pasa si la Tierra deja de girar de golpe? Sígueme y comenta.", "words": [["Parte", 0.095458, 0.402291], ["cuatro", 0.413625, 0.834083], ["Qué", 1.613625, 1.738625], ["pasa", 1.75, 2.011375], ["si", 2.022708, 2.159083], ["la", 2.170458, 2.272749], ["Tierra", 2.284083, 2.568166], ["deja", 2.579541, 2.852249], ["de", 2.863625, 2.965916], ["girar", 2.977291, 3.306832], ["de", 3.318166, 3.397707], ["golpe", 3.409083, 3.829541], ["Sígueme", 4.613625, 5.068166], ["y", 5.079541, 5.147707], ["comenta", 5.159083, 5.670458]], "dur": 5.990458}]}